# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/

# AI agent tooling — machine-local only. Nothing tool-specific is versioned:
# the agent-agnostic content lives in AGENTS.md and .ai/skills/.
.claude/

# The end-to-end environment, built by `tom e2e prepare`. Real
# repositories with real markdown in them: disposable by design, and the
# next prepare throws it away.
.e2e/

# What ran, when, and on which version. A record of this machine, kept
# beside the environment and not inside it — `tom e2e prepare` throws the
# environment away on purpose.
.e2e-results.json

# Everything the last run of each scenario printed, for the failure that
# does not happen again when you run it a second time.
.e2e-logs/
